    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_399_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is she back?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nervous Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_399_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not yet.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Unhappy Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_399_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Damn, it was hard enough dodging those devils. How did she survive and even find us\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nervous Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "How the heck did she know that I did business with the devils?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nervous Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_399_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, consider that business deal lost.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Unhappy Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_399_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What about you? How'd she get you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nervous Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_399_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "She held a crossbow to my head.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Unhappy Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "I knew her from before. She didn't used to be so\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Unhappy Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "musicvolume",
        "volume": 0.3,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$e_atk_arrowload_n",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Didn't used to be so what?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1342_1#1$1",
        "bstart": 0.2,
        "bend": 0.7,
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "musicvolume",
        "volume": 0.6,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1342_1#1$1",
        "bstart": 0.2,
        "bend": 0.7,
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Go on.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_399_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Er, no, I didn't\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Unhappy Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_chairbump",
        "volume": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$bodyfalldown1",
        "volume": 1,
        "delay": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1,
        "xstrength": 25,
        "ystrength": 35,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "The soldier, who has served the dukes all his life, lies on the ground, a crossbow pointed at his forehead."
    },
    {
        "text": "The voice of the one holding the crossbow is cold as ice."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1342_1#1$1",
        "bstart": 0.2,
        "bend": 0.7,
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm waiting.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "I just\u2014s-sorry, Millscar!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Terrified Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "I-I shouldn't have\u2014",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Terrified Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_arrowtarget",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "Aaaahh!",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "Terrified Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "text": "The bolt pierces his ear."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1342_1#1$1",
        "bstart": 0.2,
        "bend": 0.7,
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1342_1#1$1",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "200,0",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1342_1#1$1",
        "bstart": 0,
        "bend": 0,
        "duration": 2,
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1342_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Some people punch holes in their pets' ears as a sign of ownership.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Millscar"
    },
    {
        "text": "A man is not a pet, of course... but sometimes they're not so different, are they?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Millscar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Terrified Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1342_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now get back up and give me a status report.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Millscar"
    },
    {
        "text": "Have you done what I've asked of you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Millscar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovementsp",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 20,
        "ystrength": 20,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_399_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Y-Yes, ma'am!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Terrified Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "W-well, the reception at the monitoring station was really bad, so even though we tried to gather as much information as possible\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Terrified Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1342_1#6$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Skip to the conclusion.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Millscar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_399_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Based on what little information the Trilby Asher left behind, and the occasional intercepted comms, we can confirm that a unit called 'the Exemplars' has been formed, and its leader is most likely the one you spoke of...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Terrified Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "'Vina'.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Terrified Soldier"
    },
    {
        "text": "They seem to be headed for the front at Silverrock Bluffs.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Terrified Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1342_1#7$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Silverrock Bluffs. They're really staying in this war.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Millscar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1342_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Keep at it. Notify me of any new developments.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Millscar"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_399_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Y-Yes, ma'am!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Terrified Soldier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
