        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Forty-three hours into the operation..."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "43_g2_giantmonsterspine",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1067_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I knew you would come.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ul\u0161ulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4088_hodrer_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4088_hodrer_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Ul\u0161ulah.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_ironchaindrop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1067_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "That mad bomber W came once to set up this prison.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ul\u0161ulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ines came twice to show 'compassion'. Same old Ines, always a tad slow with her retort when she's focused on someone else's shadow.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ul\u0161ulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, it's you. What have you come to say?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ul\u0161ulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4088_hodrer_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Have you thought it over?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1067_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's my line.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ul\u0161ulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your situation is perilous. Your only vehicle lies disabled.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ul\u0161ulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "As the pilot, I'm very likely to know something that you don't, and probably am waiting for the right time to strike.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ul\u0161ulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "Really, you should kill me, Hoederer.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ul\u0161ulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4088_hodrer_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I would rather you helped us with what you know.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1067_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "In your dreams.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ul\u0161ulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "I already turned you down once. You give me too little credit if you think I would change my mind just because I'm a prisoner.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ul\u0161ulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4088_hodrer_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Three times.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1067_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ul\u0161ulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4088_hodrer_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You saved our lives three times back in Kazdel. My life once, Ines's life twice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1067_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You wrote all that in your diary?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ul\u0161ulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4088_hodrer_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Name your price. I'll do my best to pay it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1067_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "You'll go bankrupt if you quit the mercenary life to open a business.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ul\u0161ulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4088_hodrer_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I just want as many Sarkaz to make it back to Kazdel alive as possible.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1067_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Such grand ambitions.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ul\u0161ulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1067_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "But enough chitchat. Let the old rules of Scar Market lie buried beneath Kazdel. Our debt is settled.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ul\u0161ulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "One last warning, Hoederer. Kill me now, or you'll regret it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ul\u0161ulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4088_hodrer_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Did it ever occur to you that we both want the same thing\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoederer"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1067_1#2$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Enough of your righteous crap.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ul\u0161ulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1067_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't try to buy my life with your flowery words, old friend. They're not much better than money.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ul\u0161ulah"
    },
    {
        "text": "A mercenary takes no sides. But you and I aren't really mercenaries anymore.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ul\u0161ulah"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
    },
    {
