    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_412_1#10$1",
        "duration": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_412_1#10$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wanna bet, Ines?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hoederer's gonna try talking Ul\u0161ulah into helping for old time's sake at Scar Market. Ul\u0161ulah's gonna tell him to just get it over with, and Hoederer's gonna come back with a long face.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's the wager?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_412_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's it? I figured you'd be jealous with the two of them all alone in a room together.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#9$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...W.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_412_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stop trying to read my shadow, Ines. I'm not in the mood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "The bunny and the Victorian have been gone for a while... wonder how things are going out there.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Bonesy is still playing dead, and Theresis's Catastrophe refuses to go away. Who knows, maybe Manfred's gonna just pop out of nowhere.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_412_1#6$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I could have blown Theresis up right then and there!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I know you're restless because of Theresa, but hold that fuse for a moment. We have a lot of prep work to do.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_412_1#11$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 25,
        "ystrength": 25,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "*Sarkaz swearing*! Who said I was\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral",
        "volume": 0.9
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1336_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$nervous_intro",
        "key": "$nervous_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1336_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've got a problem, W...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_412_1#13$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Out with it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1336_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's time for a shift change, but not all our scouts came back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Crane's team went off to the north side of the canyon, and we can't reach them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_412_1#13$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't tell me they ran into a decent enemy caster.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "When was your last communication?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1336_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Almost three hours ago.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#10$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "If our enemy could make an entire merc squad disappear without a sound, they would've been on top of us by now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "The most important thing to do at the moment is keep the Lifebone safe.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_412_1#13$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "We're just gonna sit here when we know something's going on outside?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4132_ascln_1#1$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I agree with Ines.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "text": "We know nothing about this place. The safest course of action is to concentrate our forces.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ascalon"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_412_1#11$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Cut the crap. My men are missing. I want to know why.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "If they got lost, I'll bring them back. If somebody did them in, I'll return the favor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4087_ines_1#9$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Calm down! This could be a trap to split us up\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ines"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_412_1#5$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't like playing defense. Even if it's a trap, I'll just blast them out of hiding.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Give me half a day. If I don't come back, that means I'm up against a real nasty piece of work. Don't come after me, get your defenses ready.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "If you get a call from Amiya, don't wait for me, just activate the Lifebone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_412_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'll take my own squad. No need to bother anyone else.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "You lot. Grab your weapons and follow me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
