    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "50_g18_originiumcave",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "key": "$formal_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_bodyfallvalley",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_cloakmovement",
        "volume": 1,
        "delay": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 2,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1336_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_412_1#13$1",
        "duration": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_412_1#13$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is this where they went?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1336_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Should be. This cave was all we saw when we went north into the canyon. We don't know what's inside.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hidden passage? The court's secret cache?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_412_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "If this was a secret base of the Royal Court, we'd have had a couple hundred Vampires and Nachzehrers on our asses the moment we fell in here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Based on Closure's intel, we're in the hills to the west of Londinium, a good distance from the main battlefield where those old farts are.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_412_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Somehow, though, I smell... (sniffs)",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_412_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "The old, moldy stench from someone who's been here for ages.",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't like old stuff, but I'm sure Hoederer would love it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_sandstone",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_412_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let me guess. What enemy did our lucky winners run into?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1336_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "W, when did you use your bombs?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_412_1#13$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You delusional? Did you see me use them on our way here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1336_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Then what are these burn marks on the wall?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_412_1#12$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Strange. No sign of Arts, but how do you leave marks like these on stone, then?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1336_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Did you hear that?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_412_1#12$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "What is it this time?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1336_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's the sound of someone striking iron... there's somebody here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_412_1#12$1",
        "focus": "all"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_412_1#13$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're just hearing things.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "Stop spooking yourself. Nobody's here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1336_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Do we keep going, W? I have a bad feeling about this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_412_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course. Why do you think we're here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "That's top-grade gear you all are using. I'm not rich enough to just let them rot in some cave.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1336_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Have you heard the Sarkaz legend... before Qui'lon was even born, the Sarkaz and a red dragon\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_412_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Shut up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "One historian in Hoederer is enough. Say anymore, and I'll throw you to the front\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_412_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1336_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What is it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W Squad Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_412_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Blood... but not Sarkaz.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "W"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's fresh\u2014",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "W"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$plot_intro",
        "key": "$plot_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_412_1#11$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "text": "Get ready to fight!",
        "tag": "multiline",
        "name": "W"
